{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1000_p", "source_sha256": "06449ff883acf0fb9f8d6b33143082e5a1ae335993fe4ba685d780efaaa69c4c", "ja": "（次の撮影で使う、エミリーの新しい衣装が届いた。\n和モダン風のデザイン……気に入ってくれるといいな）", "zh": "（拍摄要用的艾米莉新服装送到了。\n和风现代风格的设计……希望她会喜欢）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "b36b56fc68dd55726ca689ab68d76b4d41dc6ede6a521d34e3ad9890ec584dce", "ja": "いかがでしょう、仕掛け人さま？\nお眼鏡にかなっているでしょうか？", "zh": "您觉得如何呢，制作人大人？\n能入您的法眼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1002_p", "source_sha256": "720baabdef33206c832e9f3af379a869284ebf29c4802f10814f215084ec63fc", "ja": "バッチリだよ。ただの和装じゃなくて、\nモダン風なのが、またいいアクセントになってるな。", "zh": "非常棒。不是普通的和服装扮，而是融入了现代风格，这又成了很好的点缀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "b680cffdfb1d4aba51926e98eb1f934e05db49260903799c643f33a459969f10", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとうございます♪　私の大好きな要素を\n盛り込んでいただいたようで、とっても嬉しいです！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢您♪您似乎融入了我最喜欢的元素，我真的特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "2e47b99511dbfad6a384bca90c89228f8e4b3c2f065194237c37f5c8828b5a09", "ja": "古式ゆかしい和の装いは、私も好きですし、\n洗練された美しさを感じます。ですが……。", "zh": "我也喜欢这种古朴典雅的和风装束，能感受到其中洗练的美感。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "f032326d43c2ad4ae9adf148ccd20a65148e463c87a2a69fa415c5a50576bf10", "ja": "この衣装のように、異なる要素とも調和することが\n出来る……これこそ、まさに和の心です！", "zh": "就像这套服装一样，能够与不同的元素相协调……这才是真正的和之心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1006_p", "source_sha256": "65aceb7751686f502e0cdb604e5c9d00f89646a19b4ecef0b96d03b4889a088c", "ja": "そうだな。昔とは形が変わってきてるかもしれない。\nでもどんな形でも、根底にある心は同じだと思う。", "zh": "是啊。形式或许已经和过去有所不同了。\n但无论形式如何变化，我觉得根本的精神都是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "31d9d3bd7f6fa4cf10b7b99a7878d14f5e1df8636ee9eb3a2562beac98d4fb26", "ja": "はい。大和撫子と同じで、本当に奥が深いです……！\nこの衣装を纏う私も、もっと精進しなくては！", "zh": "是的。和大和抚子一样，真的内涵深厚……！\n穿上这身服装的我，也必须更加精进才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b04aff5734ec08a840e557fa7dff91366e18c84be74b1767774d4f643a8faa7e", "ja": "はは、力まなくても大丈夫。調和の力を持つ\nエミリーなら、ちゃんと衣装の魅力を引き出せるよ。", "zh": "哈哈，不用那么紧张。拥有调和之力的\n艾米莉，一定能充分展现出这套服装的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "b2721ddfe301d63608948d6e2c04d0dfeb2764d204a9c19d122acef99d4afbed", "ja": "調和の……。\n私に、そのような力があるのでしょうか？", "zh": "调和的……。我真的具备那样的力量吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1010_p", "source_sha256": "830acc09c97b4ddac7f7b21d712311f0f2b36b4cb77093e9b98adfc35657997b", "ja": "ああ。エミリーは、大好きな日本のことだけじゃなく、\n故郷であるイギリスにも詳しいだろ？", "zh": "是啊。艾米莉不但对自己最喜欢的日本很了解，\n对故乡英国也很熟悉吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "0e8459e91e62afc11bbe9bfa511f9a5056304912706a79f1a3aff1f507735d7e", "ja": "もちろんです！　英国にも、日本とはまた違った\n素晴らしい文化があります！", "zh": "当然了！英国也有着与日本截然不同的精彩文化！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "6be7ec9e7735e28204b538d84c143d67aa98f03ea2e723e32c68d1ec478004c0", "ja": "……？　そういった知識があることが、\n重要ということでしょうか？", "zh": "……？　您的意思是，拥有这方面的知识\n是很重要的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b4c5c2b1c85545348ebbb679fb76cecae4da0551b83930ceb32b762da5aa0896", "ja": "ははっ。知識というより、それぞれの国の良さを\n理解している部分が大事なとこかな。", "zh": "哈哈。与其说是知识，不如说是理解各个国家优点的这部分更重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2bc8cd3930377b9ebd767a855d38e7390110ff9489734cfceb8ac3a5fb8e7f25", "ja": "それは、エミリーだけが持つ魅力だ。この衣装は、\nエミリー自身の魅力も引き出してくれると思うんだ。", "zh": "那是只有艾米莉才拥有的魅力。这套服装也能把艾米莉自身的魅力展现出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "fecfa2e3f64753ecbf9cf7023f5b4ce46b255b33b496a6f9949cd6ac52f8a412", "ja": "どちらも知る、私だから……\nこの衣装を……。", "zh": "因为只有我，才能了解这两者……\n这套服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "2bfce854aa2196e85bd6dea898952a794134828e0052e6ee418cc50c5a09b243", "ja": "嬉しいです、仕掛け人さま。私の中にある大切な\n思い出を認めていただいたような気がして……ぐすっ。", "zh": "我很开心，制作人大人。感觉就像是心中的那份珍贵回忆，得到了您的认可一样……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1017_p", "source_sha256": "110419115b3d36573b0474e892505d5fc690ce197e4507127004ec8a6ea8112d", "ja": "エ、エミリー！？", "zh": "艾、艾米莉？！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "ae3439691ff4ae3ec87142624992ca52e2be25edbed7a5d1f332a689a35a58a7", "ja": "も、申し訳ありません……！\nその……感極まって、しまって……えへへ。", "zh": "实、实在很抱歉……！\n那个……一时太激动了……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "89bdcec518e4332c64067cb4993b03d356fc33960e1e49919d845028b62ade83", "ja": "私、精一杯精進します。仕掛け人さまが考えてくれた\nこの衣装の良さを、みなさまに知ってもらえるように！", "zh": "我会全力以赴的。为了让大家都能感受到设计师为我精心设计的这套服装的美好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1020_p", "source_sha256": "9b3c7f9aaf93475e92a900c2270a6d5bfb7e977e4ed53ad57bc27578868f8354", "ja": "ああ。期待してるよ！", "zh": "嗯。我很期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1021_032emi", "source_sha256": "25ca8fc6bd9d8bde3d2e6a2456d8d8a537d182ce0a8173723effb10522aa5655", "ja": "はい！　大和撫子への憧れも、故郷への思いも。\n等しく胸に抱いたまま、頑張っていきますね！", "zh": "是！对大和抚子的憧憬，以及对故乡的思念，我都会平等地珍藏在心中，继续努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0454_1022_p", "source_sha256": "fc7d359ecd6e36b76c40fa02d216c06143013f94505e6aa8fed5716329e65d04", "ja": "（和の良さと、洋の良さ……どちらも備えるからこその\nエミリーの輝き……ステージが待ち遠しいな！）", "zh": "（兼具和风与西洋风的优点……这正是艾米莉独有的光芒……真让人等不及想看到舞台上的她了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
